OL,3,GNEWSAGrandmother's inquest adjourned
OL,4,Aover new evidence
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest into the death of a
OL,7,Fgrandmother has been adjourned after
OL,8,Fnew evidence was submitted to the
OL,9,Fcourt.
OL,11,FThe inquest heard that Linda Sykes,
OL,12,Ffrom Lytham St Annes, Lancashire, died
OL,13,Fat Royal Preston Hospital after
OL,14,Fsuffering two strokes and not receiving
OL,15,Fa thrombectomy, a procedure used to
OL,16,Fremove a blood clot from the brain.
OL,18,FThe hearing at Preston Corner's Court
OL,19,Fis examining whether Sykes should have
OL,20,Freceived specialist treatment that
OL,21,Fmight have improved her chances of
OL,22,Fsurvival.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
